"First, flash the AP_Periph device with a firmware that has the rangefinder "
"features. For the Matek AP_Periph CAN Node L431, the latest stable firmware "
"is `here. "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/AP_Periph/stable/MatekL431-Rangefinder/>`__"
msgstr ""
"首先，为 AP_Periph 设备刷入支持测距仪功能的固件。Matek AP_Periph CAN 节点 L431 的最新稳定固件可在 `此处 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/AP_Periph/stable/MatekL431-Rangefinder/>`__ "
"获取。"

